<template>
  <section class="professional-checks" aria-label="专业检查与总稿工作区" data-professional-checks>
    <header><div><small>PROFESSIONAL CHECKS · N05 / N06 / N07</small><h3>专业检查与总稿</h3><p>从来源核验到当前正文复验，逐项查看依据与缺项。</p></div><span class="badge">当前有效性：未知</span></header>
    <div class="baseline"><div><small>已保存正文版本</small><strong>{{ snapshot.document_revision }}</strong></div><div><small>检查引用</small><strong>{{ snapshot.check_ids.length }} 个引用 · 不代表有效检查</strong></div></div>
    <details><summary>固定正文摘要与检查引用</summary><p>SHA-256：{{ snapshot.body.sha256 }}</p><p>{{ snapshot.check_ids.join(' / ') || '未提供检查引用' }}</p></details>
    <p class="notice">技术结构检查仅验证结构与内部固定引用，不替代专业来源、规则或跨文件检查。原始产物与执行回执不构成审查通过或签发依据。</p>
    <ul v-if="model.warnings.length" class="warning" role="status"><li v-for="warning in model.warnings" :key="warning">{{ warning }}</li></ul>
    <nav aria-label="专业检查阶段"><button v-for="item in stages" :key="item.key" type="button" :aria-pressed="stage === item.key" @click="stage = item.key">{{ item.label }}</button></nav>
    <section v-if="stage === 'N05'" class="stage" aria-label="独立来源与规则检查">
      <h4>N05 · 独立来源与规则检查</h4><p class="muted">结构与位置先核验，语义支持性随后核验；专业争议保留给人工处理。</p>
      <p v-if="!findings" class="empty">尚未接入独立检查结果。来源可访问、位置准确、支持陈述及规则覆盖均未知。</p>
      <template v-else>
        <div class="meta"><span>目标：{{ findings.target_kind }}</span><span>目标版本：{{ findings.target_revision }}</span><span>规则版本：{{ findings.rule_revision }}</span><span>摘要关联：{{ model.findingsMatch ? '与已保存正文一致，仍待有效性核验' : '非当前正文依据' }}</span></div>
        <p class="notice">产物声明覆盖：{{ findings.coverage_complete ? '完整' : '不完整' }}。此声明不代表服务端核验完成。</p>
        <div class="coverage"><div><strong>{{ findings.required_claim_ids.length }}</strong><small>必需陈述</small></div><div><strong>{{ findings.required_rule_ids.length }}</strong><small>必需规则</small></div><div><strong>{{ model.missingClaims.length + model.missingRules.length }}</strong><small>产物中未提供结果的必需项</small></div></div>
        <p v-if="model.missingClaims.length" class="warning">缺少陈述结果：{{ model.missingClaims.join('、') }}</p><p v-if="model.missingRules.length" class="warning">缺少规则结果：{{ model.missingRules.join('、') }}</p>
        <p class="muted">未缺结果不等于结果通过；完整业务要求、独立执行身份与当前治理状态仍待服务端核验。</p>
        <h5>来源三项检查</h5><article v-for="(check, index) in findings.claim_checks" :key="index" class="row"><strong>{{ check.claim_id }}</strong><div class="chips"><span>可访问 {{ check.access_check }}</span><span>定位 {{ check.locator_check }}</span><span>支持 {{ check.support_check }}</span></div><p>{{ check.rationale }}</p><small>来源读取回执：{{ check.read_receipt_ids.join(' / ') || '未提供' }}</small></article><p v-if="!findings.claim_checks.length" class="muted">未提供陈述检查明细。</p>
        <h5>规则结果</h5><article v-for="(check, index) in findings.rule_checks" :key="index" class="row"><strong>{{ check.rule_id }} · {{ check.result }}</strong><p>{{ check.rationale }}</p><p>节点：{{ check.target_node_ids.join(' / ') || '未提供' }}</p><details><summary>来源引用（{{ check.evidence_refs.length }}）</summary><pre>{{ JSON.stringify(check.evidence_refs, null, 2) }}</pre></details></article>
        <h5>问题建议 · 非已登记问题</h5><div class="filters"><label>严重性<select v-model="severity"><option value="ALL">全部</option><option v-for="code in severityCodes" :key="code" :value="code">{{ code }}</option></select></label><label>搜索问题<input v-model="query" type="search" placeholder="问题、规则或节点" /></label></div>
        <article v-for="(issue, index) in visibleIssues" :key="index" class="row"><strong>{{ issue.severity_code }} · {{ issue.code }}</strong><p>{{ issue.message }}</p><p>规则 {{ issue.rule_id }} · 节点 {{ issue.anchor.node_id }}</p><p v-if="issue.anchor.kind === 'TEXT'">字符范围 {{ issue.anchor.start }}–{{ issue.anchor.end }}（Unicode code point）</p><p v-else>行 {{ issue.anchor.row_id || '未提供' }} · 字段 {{ issue.anchor.field_id || '未提供' }}</p><button type="button" :disabled="!model.canLocate" @click="emit('navigateWrite', issue.anchor.node_id)">返回正文定位</button><details><summary>完整位置与来源引用</summary><pre>{{ JSON.stringify({ anchor: issue.anchor, evidence_refs: issue.evidence_refs }, null, 2) }}</pre></details></article><p v-if="!visibleIssues.length" class="empty">当前筛选没有问题建议，不表示没有阻断问题。</p>
      </template>
    </section>
    <section v-else-if="stage === 'N06'" class="stage" aria-label="总稿与跨文件检查"><h4>N06 · 总稿与跨文件检查</h4><p class="muted">核对固定章节、必需结果、目录与事实关系。混用输入或影响清单不完整应阻止总稿完成。</p><p v-if="!assembly" class="empty">总稿清单未载入。必需结果、跨文件一致性与影响范围未知，不能将缺失数据当作通过。</p><template v-else><div class="meta"><span>目标 {{ assembly.target_kind }}</span><span>正文版本 {{ assembly.document_revision || '未提供' }}</span><span>规则版本 {{ assembly.rule_revision }}</span><span>{{ model.assemblyMatch ? '版本相符，业务有效性待核验' : '非当前总稿依据' }}</span></div><h5>固定章节</h5><article v-for="(section, index) in assembly.sections" :key="index" class="row"><strong>{{ section.ordinal }} · {{ section.section_id }}</strong><p>{{ section.version_kind }} / {{ section.version_id }}</p><small>SHA-256：{{ section.content_sha256 }}</small></article><p v-if="!assembly.sections.length" class="empty">清单没有章节条目；总稿是否完整未知。</p><dl><dt>必需目录节点引用</dt><dd>{{ assembly.requirement_node_ids.join(' / ') || '未提供' }}</dd><dt>固定事实版本</dt><dd>{{ assembly.fact_versions.join(' / ') || '未提供' }}</dd><dt>检查引用</dt><dd>{{ assembly.check_ids.join(' / ') || '未提供' }}</dd><dt>审查引用</dt><dd>{{ assembly.review_ids.join(' / ') || '未提供' }}</dd><dt>未解决问题引用</dt><dd>{{ assembly.unresolved_issue_ids.join(' / ') || '产物未列出，不代表当前无问题' }}</dd><dt>格式 profile 版本</dt><dd>{{ assembly.format_profile_revision }}</dd></dl><details><summary>固定来源引用（{{ assembly.evidence_refs.length }}）</summary><pre>{{ JSON.stringify(assembly.evidence_refs, null, 2) }}</pre></details><p class="notice">清单没有完整必需结果状态或跨文件关系核验明细，前端不能推导总稿完成、输入一致或缺项为零。</p></template></section>
    <section v-else class="stage" aria-label="当前正文重新检查"><h4>N07 · 当前正文重新检查</h4><p>保存或采纳正文新修订 → 对实际正文重新检查 → 核验当前有效性 → 人工审查。</p><p class="notice">候选检查不能覆盖新正文；已完成候选运行不重新打开。独立 CHECK_DOCUMENT 运行与正文状态分别展示。</p><p v-if="!checkRequest" class="empty">未载入属于当前正文的检查请求和运行明细。运行状态未知。</p><dl v-else><dt>请求目标</dt><dd>{{ checkRequest.target_kind }} / {{ checkRequest.target_revision }}</dd><dt>检查标识</dt><dd>{{ checkRequest.check_id }}</dd><dt>规则清单 / 检查产物</dt><dd>{{ checkRequest.rule_manifest_id }} / {{ checkRequest.findings_artifact_id }}</dd><dt>请求覆盖声明</dt><dd>{{ checkRequest.coverage.complete ? '完整' : '不完整' }} · 不代表当前有效</dd></dl><p v-if="model.pairedReceipt">匹配执行回执：{{ model.pairedReceipt.status }}；{{ model.pairedReceipt.issue_ids.length }} 个问题引用。执行成功不等于专业检查通过。</p><p v-else class="muted">无匹配的当前正文执行回执；不推断完成。</p><button type="button" disabled>检查当前已保存正文</button><p class="muted">专业复验执行与当前检查核验器尚未接入，不能提交或生成本地成功记录。</p><button type="button" :disabled="!active" @click="emit('navigateWrite')">返回撰写处理</button></section>
    <footer><span>当前专业检查、人工确认与签发条件：尚未核验</span><button type="button" disabled>确认章节 / 总稿</button><button type="button" disabled>签发</button></footer>
  </section>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed, ref, watch } from 'vue'
import { professionalChecksModel, filterProfessionalIssues } from '../../api/medical/document-professional-checks'
import type { ProfessionalChecksInput } from '../../api/medical/document-professional-checks'
const props = withDefaults(defineProps<ProfessionalChecksInput>(), { dirty: false, isCurrent: false, active: true })
const emit = defineEmits<{ navigateWrite: [nodeId?: string] }>()
const stages = [{ key: 'N05', label: '01 独立来源与规则' }, { key: 'N06', label: '02 总稿与跨文件' }, { key: 'N07', label: '03 当前正文复验' }] as const
const stage = ref<'N05' | 'N06' | 'N07'>('N05'), severity = ref('ALL'), query = ref('')
const model = computed(() => professionalChecksModel(props))
const severityCodes = computed(() => [...new Set(model.value.issues.map(issue => issue.severity_code))])
const visibleIssues = computed(() => filterProfessionalIssues(model.value.issues, severity.value, query.value))
watch(() => [props.snapshot.document_id, props.snapshot.document_revision, props.active, props.findings], () => { severity.value = 'ALL'; query.value = ''; stage.value = 'N05' })
</script>
<style scoped>
